# tally 2.2.1 P43 S1 (L §4.4 l.669, §6.1 l.1797): the day of movements stated same, one comparison of the days each side
# can take: undecided is HOLE-IMPRECISE "for the day of in1 and in2", one question per unknown day, each labelled by
# its own side; a one-day window against its day agrees, and a balance books the movement once (review g2fix
# same/s4_windows). Before W10: "for the day of cash", one question; HOLE-SAME of equal amounts beside the window.
=== s4_windows.tally
model s4
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input a1: money PLN
input d1: date
input d2: date
move in1: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1
move in2: transfers
  on d2
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  a1 = 100.00 PLN "s"
  d1 = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "s"
  d2 = window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-09) "s"
  same in1 = in2
ask w2: m.day for m in transfers over 2026-03
ask eqnamed: m.day for m in transfers over 2026-03 with d2 = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07)
ask oneof: m.day for m in transfers over 2026-03 with d1 = one_of([2026-03-05, 2026-03-09]), d2 = 2026-03-07
ask oneday: m.day for m in transfers over 2026-03 with d1 = window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-06), d2 = 2026-03-06
ask oneday_b: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with d1 = window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-06), d2 = 2026-03-06
ask b31: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== expect w2 eqnamed oneof oneday oneday_b b31
w2 (m = in1): ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) not precise enough for the day of in1 and in2" (in1) ?"date within window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-09) not precise enough for the day of in1 and in2" (in2)
  unknown day: d1
  unknown day: d2
  cut 2026-01-01
eqnamed (m = in1): ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) not precise enough for the day of in1 and in2" (in1, in2)
  pinned: d2 = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07)
  unknown day: d1
  unknown day: d2
  cut 2026-01-01
oneof (m = in1): ?"in1 and in2 are one, but the day of cash differs on one_of([2026-03-05, 2026-03-09]): one_of([2026-03-05, 2026-03-09]) (in1) and 2026-03-07 (in2)" (in1, in2)
  pinned: d1 = one_of([2026-03-05, 2026-03-09])
  pinned: d2 = 2026-03-07
  cut 2026-01-01
oneday (m = in1): window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-06)
  pinned: d1 = window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-06)
  pinned: d2 = 2026-03-06
  cut 2026-01-01
oneday_b: 600.00 PLN
  pinned: d1 = window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-06)
  cut 2026-01-01
b31: ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) not precise enough for a balance" (in1) ?"date within window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-09) not precise enough for a balance" (in2)
  unknown day: d1
  unknown day: d2
  cut 2026-01-01
